(2145914, 294643, 51553, '<td valign="top">I think the red is a little too intense for the mood of the image.  If the season was spring or summer perhaps.  But being winter, I would mute the red color slightly, not as much as the walkway.</td>', 'I think the red is a little too intense for the mood of the image.  If the season was spring or summer perhaps.  But being winter, I would mute the red color slightly, not as much as the walkway.', '2006-02-13 00:17:48.000000', NULL, 1),
