(2146223, 294534, 6804, '<td valign="top">Spectacular work of art!  There is so much here.  The cool breeze blowing through the open window and the farm fresh eggs. The soft colors of the first morning light and the eggs are a sure sign of an early morning breakfast.  The grain is a nice addition to give this a rustic unrefined feeling of the country.  <br/> <br/>Excellent use of gradation to bring attention to the eggs. Leadlines of color and light also help bring the focal point all together in an unconventional position.  I really love images that defy the basic principals of composition.<br/> <br/>My first 10 in this challenge.</td>', 'Spectacular work of art!  There is so much here.  The cool breeze blowing through the open window and the farm fresh eggs. The soft colors of the first morning light and the eggs are a sure sign of an early morning breakfast.  The grain is a nice addition to give this a rustic unrefined feeling of the country.   Excellent use of gradation to bring attention to the eggs. Leadlines of color and light also help bring the focal point all together in an unconventional position.  I really love images that defy the basic principals of composition. My first 10 in this challenge.', '2006-02-13 01:23:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2146224, 294636, 9906, '<td valign="top">Very nice!  Looks like a (itchy) fun time!<br/>TC</td>', 'Very nice!  Looks like a (itchy) fun time!TC', '2006-02-13 01:24:13.000000', NULL, 1),
