(2146494, 294727, 42984, '<td valign="top">There''s quite a few horse/cow portraits. Most just don''t really have any personality. Yours does, the colouring, the sky and the subdued ligting gives this image a mood and feel that others haven''t achieved. This winter light is so soft and sort of cool</td>', 'There''s quite a few horse/cow portraits. Most just don''t really have any personality. Yours does, the colouring, the sky and the subdued ligting gives this image a mood and feel that others haven''t achieved. This winter light is so soft and sort of cool', '2006-02-13 03:39:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2146495, 294409, 42984, '<td valign="top">You don''t know how much I have always wanted to spend a couple of months doing the barges of the UK and Europe. This is my kind of country life</td>', 'You don''t know how much I have always wanted to spend a couple of months doing the barges of the UK and Europe. This is my kind of country life', '2006-02-13 03:40:23.000000', NULL, 1),
