(2147872, 294720, 42984, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot, that afternoon llow light is such a nice light to work with. You possibly won''t score as high as you wanted with this because it doesn''t have a DPC ''wow'' factor. The elements are all there like low light, great texture on the coat and that lovely chestnut colouring. Closer cropping would highlight those, perhaps getting down to the horse''s level and maybe just trying to get your subject into the Rule of Thirds.</td>', 'Lovely shot, that afternoon llow light is such a nice light to work with. You possibly won''t score as high as you wanted with this because it doesn''t have a DPC ''wow'' factor. The elements are all there like low light, great texture on the coat and that lovely chestnut colouring. Closer cropping would highlight those, perhaps getting down to the horse''s level and maybe just trying to get your subject into the Rule of Thirds.', '2006-02-13 17:02:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2147873, 294952, 43437, '<td valign="top">nice elements, i am drawn into it though, and Im sure youll get this comment acouple times, its small.</td>', 'nice elements, i am drawn into it though, and Im sure youll get this comment acouple times, its small.', '2006-02-13 17:02:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2147876, 294560, 3569, '<td valign="top">Great portrait.</td>', 'Great portrait.', '2006-02-13 17:03:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2147877, 294285, 42984, '<td valign="top">Good to see someone working with a different idea. Good composition too</td>', 'Good to see someone working with a different idea. Good composition too', '2006-02-13 17:03:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2147878, 294694, 3569, '<td valign="top">even a nice smail.  I like it.</td>', 'even a nice smail.  I like it.', '2006-02-13 17:03:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2147881, 294700, 43437, '<td valign="top">very nice setting, i wish the branches on the left werent there though.  Id like to see the full whatever it is on the left side.</td>', 'very nice setting, i wish the branches on the left werent there though.  Id like to see the full whatever it is on the left side.', '2006-02-13 17:04:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2147882, 293910, 3569, '<td valign="top">In our area reminds me of city park.  But thats okay.  Nice mallards</td>', 'In our area reminds me of city park.  But thats okay.  Nice mallards', '2006-02-13 17:04:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2147883, 294268, 3569, '<td valign="top">Wonderful winter shot.</td>', 'Wonderful winter shot.', '2006-02-13 17:04:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2147884, 292501, 42984, '<td valign="top">Great landscape composition without the skier. With the skier you have added ''life'' and humour and interest. Well done.</td>', 'Great landscape composition without the skier. With the skier you have added ''life'' and humour and interest. Well done.', '2006-02-13 17:04:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2147885, 294512, 43437, '<td valign="top">capturing the quiet moment.</td>', 'capturing the quiet moment.', '2006-02-13 17:05:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2147892, 294887, 3569, '<td valign="top">Damn thats good whisky.  Nice contrasts.</td>', 'Damn thats good whisky.  Nice contrasts.', '2006-02-13 17:06:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2147894, 293328, 43437, '<td valign="top">very nice, love the reflections of the trees and the clouds in the water. There is something a little funny about the tree on the right but its probably just ripples in the water.</td>', 'very nice, love the reflections of the trees and the clouds in the water. There is something a little funny about the tree on the right but its probably just ripples in the water.', '2006-02-13 17:06:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2147898, 294791, 42984, '<td valign="top">Haha, you might be slightly up the creek with this one. There''s something strange with the colouring. Is it too much contrast or is it a hue/saturation thing? The giveaway is the blue shadows. Snow is so hard to shoot it''s so easy to loose the texture. True, a polarizing filter helps.</td>', 'Haha, you might be slightly up the creek with this one. There''s something strange with the colouring. Is it too much contrast or is it a hue/saturation thing? The giveaway is the blue shadows. Snow is so hard to shoot it''s so easy to loose the texture. True, a polarizing filter helps.', '2006-02-13 17:07:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2147902, 294968, 3569, '<td valign="top">Wonderful later/early sun shot.</td>', 'Wonderful later/early sun shot.', '2006-02-13 17:08:27.000000', NULL, 1);
