(2148093, 294145, 50982, '<td valign="top">The sky makes this great. There do look to be some dodged (lighter) areas that stand out more than they should, particularly around all the animals. It''s a big difference between the ground around the empty field areas.<br/>But really, the sky. Nice.<br/>Bump - 9</td>', 'The sky makes this great. There do look to be some dodged (lighter) areas that stand out more than they should, particularly around all the animals. It''s a big difference between the ground around the empty field areas.But really, the sky. Nice.Bump - 9', '2006-02-13 18:23:46.000000', NULL, 1),
