(2148167, 294692, 51875, '<td valign="top">Overall pretty good, I''m just not sure about the semi-transparent border here. I think I''d have tried with a little less pond, although you''d have missed the ducks and perhaps some of that nice reflection in the water then :) Cropping right above the head of the duck furthest to the right would''ve done a difference for me.</td>', 'Overall pretty good, I''m just not sure about the semi-transparent border here. I think I''d have tried with a little less pond, although you''d have missed the ducks and perhaps some of that nice reflection in the water then :) Cropping right above the head of the duck furthest to the right would''ve done a difference for me.', '2006-02-13 18:47:25.000000', NULL, 1),
