(2149256, 294725, 48545, '<td valign="top">In some countries this could be country life, however it can just as easily be grown in the city.  Therefore, my point is, it doesn''t really give me the feeling of life in the country.  In terms of the photo, the greens and the oranges compliment each other really well, however the sky in the top right is really distracting.</td>', 'In some countries this could be country life, however it can just as easily be grown in the city.  Therefore, my point is, it doesn''t really give me the feeling of life in the country.  In terms of the photo, the greens and the oranges compliment each other really well, however the sky in the top right is really distracting.', '2006-02-14 03:54:05.000000', NULL, 1),
