(2149573, 293489, 31885, '<td valign="top">Beautiful protrait with a very pretty girl. The pose is nice and the lighting is good. The shadow of her chin on her hand is a little distracting. On my monitor there seems to be a strange yellow section in the centre of her arm with an abrupt transition to orange - maybe due to sponge saturation tool? I would have tried to do something with that one tooth - it''s not the tooth as much as the gap between it and the upper lip. This turned out to be a much longer comment than I intended - it does not mean I don''t like it!</td>', 'Beautiful protrait with a very pretty girl. The pose is nice and the lighting is good. The shadow of her chin on her hand is a little distracting. On my monitor there seems to be a strange yellow section in the centre of her arm with an abrupt transition to orange - maybe due to sponge saturation tool? I would have tried to do something with that one tooth - it''s not the tooth as much as the gap between it and the upper lip. This turned out to be a much longer comment than I intended - it does not mean I don''t like it!', '2006-02-14 09:38:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2149578, 294382, 31885, '<td valign="top">Wonderful idea and great image! I think the focus on the hands is a little too soft.</td>', 'Wonderful idea and great image! I think the focus on the hands is a little too soft.', '2006-02-14 09:42:38.000000', NULL, 1),
