(2150785, 294719, 30982, '<td valign="top">This is good to show the expansiveness of the country, but kind of lacks a central "focus" point to draw the eye.</td>', 'This is good to show the expansiveness of the country, but kind of lacks a central "focus" point to draw the eye.', '2006-02-14 20:54:55.000000', NULL, 1),
