(2150801, 294171, 30982, '<td valign="top">The road challenge was a couple back.... No, seriously, this is a nice depiction of the open prarie.</td>', 'The road challenge was a couple back.... No, seriously, this is a nice depiction of the open prarie.', '2006-02-14 21:01:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2150803, 294560, 30982, '<td valign="top">Great rooster portrait!  Lighting is gorgeous and the background works very well here.</td>', 'Great rooster portrait!  Lighting is gorgeous and the background works very well here.', '2006-02-14 21:01:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2150807, 294727, 30982, '<td valign="top">Good picture as it is, but I''d like it even better if the right side were cropped a bit, say just to cut out the washtub. I really do like the "busy" background of the tree, the stable, the fences.  Works well.</td>', 'Good picture as it is, but I''d like it even better if the right side were cropped a bit, say just to cut out the washtub. I really do like the "busy" background of the tree, the stable, the fences.  Works well.', '2006-02-14 21:03:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2150809, 294285, 30982, '<td valign="top">I swear I''ve seen this sign somewhere...</td>', 'I swear I''ve seen this sign somewhere...', '2006-02-14 21:04:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2150837, 294824, 24454, '<td valign="top">Tee hee. . .You''re talking to a snow-deprived Texan here. . .and I think this picture is soo cool.  I want to be there!!    Great job showing a snowy country scene!  Love it!</td>', 'Tee hee. . .You''re talking to a snow-deprived Texan here. . .and I think this picture is soo cool.  I want to be there!!    Great job showing a snowy country scene!  Love it!', '2006-02-14 21:19:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2150839, 294905, 24454, '<td valign="top">Tee hee. . .that is so cute!</td>', 'Tee hee. . .that is so cute!', '2006-02-14 21:20:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2150840, 293455, 24454, '<td valign="top">Ohhhhhh. . . what a beautiful cow portrait!   She is such a beauty!   Her fur looks velvety, and the greens of the grass make a great bokeh background.   I happen to love cow pictures, so this one has that extra emotional appeal that makes me vote very high :)  9</td>', 'Ohhhhhh. . . what a beautiful cow portrait!   She is such a beauty!   Her fur looks velvety, and the greens of the grass make a great bokeh background.   I happen to love cow pictures, so this one has that extra emotional appeal that makes me vote very high :)  9', '2006-02-14 21:21:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2150843, 294510, 24454, '<td valign="top">Awwwwwwww. .. .that cat looks exactly like my Smudge cat!    What a cool photo!!!  I love this!  Love it!</td>', 'Awwwwwwww. .. .that cat looks exactly like my Smudge cat!    What a cool photo!!!  I love this!  Love it!', '2006-02-14 21:22:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2150848, 294162, 24454, '<td valign="top">Ohhhhhh. . .this makes my heart sick for Kentucky.   The most beautiful state!   What lovely composition!   I love the stand-out sharpness of your mailbox and fence osts, contrasted against the misty snowy scene around.  This is one of my favorites!  Good Luck!</td>', 'Ohhhhhh. . .this makes my heart sick for Kentucky.   The most beautiful state!   What lovely composition!   I love the stand-out sharpness of your mailbox and fence osts, contrasted against the misty snowy scene around.  This is one of my favorites!  Good Luck!', '2006-02-14 21:23:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2150853, 294835, 24454, '<td valign="top">Ohmygoodness.  I LOVE this!!!   That is a HUGE sheep isn''t it???   Or else that is a very tiny goat.   I love how the goat is just so happy to pose for you.   This is awesome.</td>', 'Ohmygoodness.  I LOVE this!!!   That is a HUGE sheep isn''t it???   Or else that is a very tiny goat.   I love how the goat is just so happy to pose for you.   This is awesome.', '2006-02-14 21:24:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2150858, 293893, 24454, '<td valign="top">How pretty!   How nice it would be to live in all that private open space!  Very nice photo!</td>', 'How pretty!   How nice it would be to live in all that private open space!  Very nice photo!', '2006-02-14 21:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2150863, 294920, 24454, '<td valign="top">This is awesome!  I am so in love with these photos that show every character line in the face as 3-dimensional.  He looks so happy and full of life.   Beautiful photo!</td>', 'This is awesome!  I am so in love with these photos that show every character line in the face as 3-dimensional.  He looks so happy and full of life.   Beautiful photo!', '2006-02-14 21:27:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2150882, 294290, 24454, '<td valign="top">Ohhhhhwuh!!!  That is so CUTE!!!   I love how wonderful and rich the colors look, and that face is to die for -- licking his nose!!  Couldn''t possibly say country life more than this. . .and I LOVE it. . .so it gets a 10 from me!!!</td>', 'Ohhhhhwuh!!!  That is so CUTE!!!   I love how wonderful and rich the colors look, and that face is to die for -- licking his nose!!  Couldn''t possibly say country life more than this. . .and I LOVE it. . .so it gets a 10 from me!!!', '2006-02-14 21:32:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2150896, 293489, 24454, '<td valign="top">That is such a spectacular portrait!  It does seem just a tad of a stretch for the challenge, but I''ve never been one to be that narrow about letting people use their own interpretation of a challenge. . .and a picture this fabulous just doesn''t deserve anything but a wonderful score!   It''s just perfect!  10</td>', 'That is such a spectacular portrait!  It does seem just a tad of a stretch for the challenge, but I''ve never been one to be that narrow about letting people use their own interpretation of a challenge. . .and a picture this fabulous just doesn''t deserve anything but a wonderful score!   It''s just perfect!  10', '2006-02-14 21:35:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2150900, 294661, 24454, '<td valign="top">Awwww. . .this one gets extra points because it made me smile!  Those cows are so cute.   They look like they like having their picture taken too, eh???  Good Luck!!!</td>', 'Awwww. . .this one gets extra points because it made me smile!  Those cows are so cute.   They look like they like having their picture taken too, eh???  Good Luck!!!', '2006-02-14 21:36:34.000000', NULL, 1),
