(2150912, 294963, 24454, '<td valign="top">Isn''t he CUTE!  He looks like he''s sticking his nose and horns right out of the picture at me.   And I love how the cow in the background looks like he''s wondering what''s going on.   Very cute photo and executed very well!</td>', 'Isn''t he CUTE!  He looks like he''s sticking his nose and horns right out of the picture at me.   And I love how the cow in the background looks like he''s wondering what''s going on.   Very cute photo and executed very well!', '2006-02-14 21:39:02.000000', NULL, 1),
