(2152937, 292117, 35545, '<td valign="top">Good picture, but I don''t see "country" in it.  You could have shot this in the city just as well.</td>', 'Good picture, but I don''t see "country" in it.  You could have shot this in the city just as well.', '2006-02-15 09:09:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2152939, 294831, 35545, '<td valign="top">Country Life??</td>', 'Country Life??', '2006-02-15 09:10:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2152944, 293985, 35545, '<td valign="top">Did you mean coop or are the chickes staging a coup?  Nice picture and pretty subtle.  I had to look for the chickens.</td>', 'Did you mean coop or are the chickes staging a coup?  Nice picture and pretty subtle.  I had to look for the chickens.', '2006-02-15 09:13:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2152964, 292158, 35545, '<td valign="top">The blurred grass in the foreground is really distracting.</td>', 'The blurred grass in the foreground is really distracting.', '2006-02-15 09:22:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2152971, 294647, 35545, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition, but I think it would come across better printed out rather than on a computer screen.  I had to scroll to see the whole thing and almost missed that the solid white line across the bottom was more snow.  The trees are beautiful, but I think for purposes of viewing on a computer monitor, you would have done better with a shorter, squarer crop.</td>', 'Interesting composition, but I think it would come across better printed out rather than on a computer screen.  I had to scroll to see the whole thing and almost missed that the solid white line across the bottom was more snow.  The trees are beautiful, but I think for purposes of viewing on a computer monitor, you would have done better with a shorter, squarer crop.', '2006-02-15 09:25:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2152978, 294047, 35320, '<td valign="top">ture contry! love how it is off center to show the barn in the back.</td>', 'ture contry! love how it is off center to show the barn in the back.', '2006-02-15 09:30:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2153008, 293652, 35545, '<td valign="top">IMHO this picture needs some work.  It''s hard to see the rooster on the busy background.  You need to do something (adjust contrast, maybe) to make him stand out from the background.</td>', 'IMHO this picture needs some work.  It''s hard to see the rooster on the busy background.  You need to do something (adjust contrast, maybe) to make him stand out from the background.', '2006-02-15 09:41:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2153031, 292347, 35545, '<td valign="top">I like the church and the green roof, but there seems to be a blur on the edges.  I''d like to see the whole thing in sharp focus.</td>', 'I like the church and the green roof, but there seems to be a blur on the edges.  I''d like to see the whole thing in sharp focus.', '2006-02-15 09:44:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2153051, 292963, 35545, '<td valign="top">I really, really like this.  Good colors, good focus, good everything.  This is just me, but I probably would have cropped it off above the trees, so you have a strong leading line down to the building.  Either way, it''s a great shot.</td>', 'I really, really like this.  Good colors, good focus, good everything.  This is just me, but I probably would have cropped it off above the trees, so you have a strong leading line down to the building.  Either way, it''s a great shot.', '2006-02-15 09:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2153057, 294361, 35545, '<td valign="top">Good subject, and the colors give a real feeling of desolation.  I''ve got mixed feelings about the wires.  Barbed wire certainly gives a "country" feel, but I''m not sure it adds that much across the middle of this picture.</td>', 'Good subject, and the colors give a real feeling of desolation.  I''ve got mixed feelings about the wires.  Barbed wire certainly gives a "country" feel, but I''m not sure it adds that much across the middle of this picture.', '2006-02-15 09:49:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2153061, 294591, 35545, '<td valign="top">Red, white, and blue.  What a graphic.</td>', 'Red, white, and blue.  What a graphic.', '2006-02-15 09:50:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2153298, 294952, 35739, '<td valign="top">Size is the biggest issue here.  I would like to see it alttle larger.</td>', 'Size is the biggest issue here.  I would like to see it alttle larger.', '2006-02-15 10:45:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2153312, 292639, 35739, '<td valign="top">Out of focus and as I can see it the colors are not quite right.  Even the tree trunks have too much red in it.  A little oversat on the red.  Looks like it is a beautiful place.  Try again.</td>', 'Out of focus and as I can see it the colors are not quite right.  Even the tree trunks have too much red in it.  A little oversat on the red.  Looks like it is a beautiful place.  Try again.', '2006-02-15 10:47:07.000000', NULL, 1),
