(2158443, 294591, 42792, '<td valign="top">Makes a nice art poster.</td>', 'Makes a nice art poster.', '2006-02-17 04:55:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2158444, 293069, 42792, '<td valign="top">Overall pretty but the light looks artificial, like it''s staged and she''s under a spotlight or something.  So the notion of "home" just doesn''t cut it.</td>', 'Overall pretty but the light looks artificial, like it''s staged and she''s under a spotlight or something.  So the notion of "home" just doesn''t cut it.', '2006-02-17 04:58:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2158449, 293952, 42792, '<td valign="top">Great comp!  Love the vastness depicted in the sky, contrasted with the lone cowboy. And the haystacks add a cool dimension.  But could it be that the magenta tones are a little too strong?</td>', 'Great comp!  Love the vastness depicted in the sky, contrasted with the lone cowboy. And the haystacks add a cool dimension.  But could it be that the magenta tones are a little too strong?', '2006-02-17 05:03:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2158464, 294956, 42792, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition.  You''ve made the slope, the tree, clouds and sky work together quite effectively.  Would have scored it higher if it weren''t for the overall soft quality.  Nothing really looks sharp here and apart from the blue of the sky, the other colours look dull.  The double layer black and green border doesn''t help either.</td>', 'Interesting composition.  You''ve made the slope, the tree, clouds and sky work together quite effectively.  Would have scored it higher if it weren''t for the overall soft quality.  Nothing really looks sharp here and apart from the blue of the sky, the other colours look dull.  The double layer black and green border doesn''t help either.', '2006-02-17 05:26:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2158465, 294441, 42792, '<td valign="top">This is one of those photos where size counts and here at DPC challenge, it''s probably not placed at an advantage.  Would have loved to see the details.  As is, I can only vote based on what I can tell. 5.</td>', 'This is one of those photos where size counts and here at DPC challenge, it''s probably not placed at an advantage.  Would have loved to see the details.  As is, I can only vote based on what I can tell. 5.', '2006-02-17 05:29:33.000000', NULL, 1),
