(2159370, 293652, 30896, '<td valign="top">cool rooster :-)<br/> <br/>the picture seems to lack contrast, some dodging/burning (or different angle) could bring out the rooster and draw more attention to the photo in general imho</td>', 'cool rooster :-) the picture seems to lack contrast, some dodging/burning (or different angle) could bring out the rooster and draw more attention to the photo in general imho', '2006-02-17 15:21:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2159505, 294708, 30896, '<td valign="top">yum, great framing, the part on the left really adds</td>', 'yum, great framing, the part on the left really adds', '2006-02-17 17:03:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2159515, 294604, 3087, '<td valign="top">Pretty landscape and taken under some nice light. Main problem for me is that distance makes it too difficult to discern any detail in the settlement. I either want to see more detail there or not have it interrupt the landscape at all. As it is it just kind of makes it a bit messy. You have some nice detail in the sky, I think it would be stronger if you used a polarising filter to darken up the blues and bring out contrast between the clouds and the sky.</td>', 'Pretty landscape and taken under some nice light. Main problem for me is that distance makes it too difficult to discern any detail in the settlement. I either want to see more detail there or not have it interrupt the landscape at all. As it is it just kind of makes it a bit messy. You have some nice detail in the sky, I think it would be stronger if you used a polarising filter to darken up the blues and bring out contrast between the clouds and the sky.', '2006-02-17 17:13:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2159619, 293069, 3032, '<td valign="top">Too much smoothing going on here and there but I like the basic (when I think away the smoothing) photograph.</td>', 'Too much smoothing going on here and there but I like the basic (when I think away the smoothing) photograph.', '2006-02-17 18:38:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2159621, 293868, 3032, '<td valign="top">I like the mood of this, but it looks slightly oversharpened.</td>', 'I like the mood of this, but it looks slightly oversharpened.', '2006-02-17 18:39:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2159625, 293726, 3032, '<td valign="top">Would be better with a warmer whitebalance. When you cannot correct whitebalance, try the color balance sliders of your program. Attempt to replace the blue. Another option is a whitepoint curves sample on the brightes blue/magenta section.</td>', 'Would be better with a warmer whitebalance. When you cannot correct whitebalance, try the color balance sliders of your program. Attempt to replace the blue. Another option is a whitepoint curves sample on the brightes blue/magenta section.', '2006-02-17 18:41:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2159628, 294383, 3032, '<td valign="top">Cool wide perspective, but the elements in the photograph are a bit distant. A strong close element in the front would benefit the scene here.</td>', 'Cool wide perspective, but the elements in the photograph are a bit distant. A strong close element in the front would benefit the scene here.', '2006-02-17 18:42:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2159636, 294361, 3032, '<td valign="top">At first thought you think: "The barb wire lines screw this up." But at second thought it gives a feeling of "nobody enters here", enhancing the empty house. Unfortunate that the sky is a bit blah, it could have given this more impact.</td>', 'At first thought you think: "The barb wire lines screw this up." But at second thought it gives a feeling of "nobody enters here", enhancing the empty house. Unfortunate that the sky is a bit blah, it could have given this more impact.', '2006-02-17 18:48:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2159675, 293652, 3032, '<td valign="top">Funny, when you pronounce rooster in dutch and take the literal translation you get ''roester'', not a real word but it indicates ''roestig'' and that translates back to English as ''oxidated'' and that''s what this rooster is. :)</td>', 'Funny, when you pronounce rooster in dutch and take the literal translation you get ''roester'', not a real word but it indicates ''roestig'' and that translates back to English as ''oxidated'' and that''s what this rooster is. :)', '2006-02-17 19:18:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2159677, 294488, 3032, '<td valign="top">I''d prefer this 100% b&amp;w or 100% color. I like the photo, but not the selective desat.</td>', 'I''d prefer this 100% b&w or 100% color. I like the photo, but not the selective desat.', '2006-02-17 19:20:20.000000', NULL, 1),
