(2160084, 294589, 50695, '<td valign="top">nice mystery in this photo. the title is unconvincing, and one wonders what the relationship is between person and building. There''s a whole sky and another reflected sky between the two. Yet they are symmetrical within the frame, both on the horizon line.</td>', 'nice mystery in this photo. the title is unconvincing, and one wonders what the relationship is between person and building. There''s a whole sky and another reflected sky between the two. Yet they are symmetrical within the frame, both on the horizon line.', '2006-02-17 22:01:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2160085, 294688, 50695, '<td valign="top">great texture in this shot.</td>', 'great texture in this shot.', '2006-02-17 22:01:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2160087, 294896, 50695, '<td valign="top">I like the frenzied busy-ness of this shot.</td>', 'I like the frenzied busy-ness of this shot.', '2006-02-17 22:02:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2160088, 293503, 50695, '<td valign="top">I like how the horses have been reduced to icons. It adds a sense of majesty to the mountains behind them.</td>', 'I like how the horses have been reduced to icons. It adds a sense of majesty to the mountains behind them.', '2006-02-17 22:02:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2160090, 294756, 50695, '<td valign="top">I''m tough on sunset shots, but the sky has different layers to it, adding to the interest of it, and the hint of ground has nice color. Well done.</td>', 'I''m tough on sunset shots, but the sky has different layers to it, adding to the interest of it, and the hint of ground has nice color. Well done.', '2006-02-17 22:04:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2160091, 293985, 50695, '<td valign="top">great flat abstract composition. and I like the implied relationship between cat and chickens.</td>', 'great flat abstract composition. and I like the implied relationship between cat and chickens.', '2006-02-17 22:04:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2160093, 293724, 48890, '<td valign="top">Great perspective.  I am wishing for more details in around the eyes.</td>', 'Great perspective.  I am wishing for more details in around the eyes.', '2006-02-17 22:08:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2160100, 294688, 48890, '<td valign="top">Nice composition</td>', 'Nice composition', '2006-02-17 22:12:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2160101, 294560, 48890, '<td valign="top">Great portrait!</td>', 'Great portrait!', '2006-02-17 22:13:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2160139, 293900, 48890, '<td valign="top">This shot lacks dynamics to match the title.  It looks very static and set-up.  Otherwise a nice silhouette.</td>', 'This shot lacks dynamics to match the title.  It looks very static and set-up.  Otherwise a nice silhouette.', '2006-02-17 22:32:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2160147, 294873, 48890, '<td valign="top">Boy, have you oversharpened this shot!  You''ve ruined, unfortunately, an otherwise very beautiful picure.</td>', 'Boy, have you oversharpened this shot!  You''ve ruined, unfortunately, an otherwise very beautiful picure.', '2006-02-17 22:37:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2160170, 294877, 33947, '<td valign="top">Excellent clarity and rich tones. Love the point of view and tight cropping. 10!</td>', 'Excellent clarity and rich tones. Love the point of view and tight cropping. 10!', '2006-02-17 22:50:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2160172, 293753, 33947, '<td valign="top">Love the wide angle shot. Lighting is superb. 10</td>', 'Love the wide angle shot. Lighting is superb. 10', '2006-02-17 22:51:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2160176, 294576, 33947, '<td valign="top">Exquisite lighting.</td>', 'Exquisite lighting.', '2006-02-17 22:52:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2160180, 293585, 33947, '<td valign="top">Great shot. Love the highlights especially on the rear feathers. Nice sharpness.</td>', 'Great shot. Love the highlights especially on the rear feathers. Nice sharpness.', '2006-02-17 22:54:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2160181, 294835, 42984, '<td valign="top">Good clarity and light here. Nice sharp subjects too. In scoring, it''s not a remarkable shot but it is well crafted.</td>', 'Good clarity and light here. Nice sharp subjects too. In scoring, it''s not a remarkable shot but it is well crafted.', '2006-02-17 22:55:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2160183, 294941, 33947, '<td valign="top">Great capture. Outstanding lighting on the roof.</td>', 'Great capture. Outstanding lighting on the roof.', '2006-02-17 22:55:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2160186, 294288, 42984, '<td valign="top">Yup, that makes it fairly country. Nce statement made too. In voting, not a remarkable shot, just a competent one.</td>', 'Yup, that makes it fairly country. Nce statement made too. In voting, not a remarkable shot, just a competent one.', '2006-02-17 22:56:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2160187, 294175, 48890, '<td valign="top">This is a very nice shot.  The composition is interesting: there is something interesting to look at in the fore-, middle- and background, the frame is filled very well.  The exposure is just right.  The title suits the picture very well. 10</td>', 'This is a very nice shot.  The composition is interesting: there is something interesting to look at in the fore-, middle- and background, the frame is filled very well.  The exposure is just right.  The title suits the picture very well. 10', '2006-02-17 22:56:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2160188, 294709, 33947, '<td valign="top">I LOVE this shot! What a fun perspective. Excellent lighting and sharpness. Big 10. One of my favs.</td>', 'I LOVE this shot! What a fun perspective. Excellent lighting and sharpness. Big 10. One of my favs.', '2006-02-17 22:57:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2160191, 293291, 48890, '<td valign="top">A fantastic capture.  The composition and exposure are impecable.  Some may say that this is not country living in the conventional sense of that idiom, but this is definitely a countryside.  My favourite in this challenge. 10</td>', 'A fantastic capture.  The composition and exposure are impecable.  Some may say that this is not country living in the conventional sense of that idiom, but this is definitely a countryside.  My favourite in this challenge. 10', '2006-02-17 22:58:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2160193, 293985, 48890, '<td valign="top">Very unusual and interesting composition. There is so much going on in this shot: the clothes, the cat, the chickens, and the tire. :) 9</td>', 'Very unusual and interesting composition. There is so much going on in this shot: the clothes, the cat, the chickens, and the tire. :) 9', '2006-02-17 22:59:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2160195, 294175, 33947, '<td valign="top">What a neat, shaggy little guy. Great capture. Like how he''s right up front in the frame. Like the subtle tones throughout. 10</td>', 'What a neat, shaggy little guy. Great capture. Like how he''s right up front in the frame. Like the subtle tones throughout. 10', '2006-02-17 23:00:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2160199, 293157, 33947, '<td valign="top">I REALLY like this as an abstract. Well lit, good contrast, rich tones.  7</td>', 'I REALLY like this as an abstract. Well lit, good contrast, rich tones.  7', '2006-02-17 23:02:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2160200, 294384, 48890, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition and use of deep DOF.The perspective is fantastic.  The only thing missing, IMO, is the blank top right corner. 9</td>', 'Very nice composition and use of deep DOF.The perspective is fantastic.  The only thing missing, IMO, is the blank top right corner. 9', '2006-02-17 23:02:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2160202, 294657, 48890, '<td valign="top">Very nice colour, textures, and composition.  Great find! 9</td>', 'Very nice colour, textures, and composition.  Great find! 9', '2006-02-17 23:03:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2160203, 294745, 33947, '<td valign="top">Love how the sky blends into deeper tones up high. Also, like the perspective and the house way off in the distance. There''s a beautiful silence about this shot.</td>', 'Love how the sky blends into deeper tones up high. Also, like the perspective and the house way off in the distance. There''s a beautiful silence about this shot.', '2006-02-17 23:04:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2160204, 294534, 48890, '<td valign="top">A lovely still life.  THe only thing I don''t like is that the right side of the table is blown out. 9</td>', 'A lovely still life.  THe only thing I don''t like is that the right side of the table is blown out. 9', '2006-02-17 23:04:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2160206, 294162, 33947, '<td valign="top">Very lovely. Like the soft feel of it.</td>', 'Very lovely. Like the soft feel of it.', '2006-02-17 23:04:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2160207, 294499, 48890, '<td valign="top">Great capture: a very dynamic shot. 9</td>', 'Great capture: a very dynamic shot. 9', '2006-02-17 23:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2160211, 294467, 42984, '<td valign="top">I just love the light and feeling of this. Also impressed with the crispness of the contrail and whispy gold clouds. In voting, I don''t feel it''s strong on being ''country life'' although it is in the country, the life part isn''t strong enough to score well against the competition.</td>', 'I just love the light and feeling of this. Also impressed with the crispness of the contrail and whispy gold clouds. In voting, I don''t feel it''s strong on being ''country life'' although it is in the country, the life part isn''t strong enough to score well against the competition.', '2006-02-17 23:07:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2160212, 294899, 33947, '<td valign="top">Super sharp, and well lit. Nicely positioned.</td>', 'Super sharp, and well lit. Nicely positioned.', '2006-02-17 23:07:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2160225, 293067, 42984, '<td valign="top">The problem you have with this is that the auto-focus has picked the leaves instead of the fruit. In voting, that is going to cost you a couple of voting points. Then it is also likely that since these could be in a city garden or a rooftop apartment garden, you''re going to loose points for the image not being able to prove that it''s in th country. Then there will also be those who don''t feel that fruit show ''life''. So it''s an uphill battle and this is a tough school.</td>', 'The problem you have with this is that the auto-focus has picked the leaves instead of the fruit. In voting, that is going to cost you a couple of voting points. Then it is also likely that since these could be in a city garden or a rooftop apartment garden, you''re going to loose points for the image not being able to prove that it''s in th country. Then there will also be those who don''t feel that fruit show ''life''. So it''s an uphill battle and this is a tough school.', '2006-02-17 23:21:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2160233, 293893, 42984, '<td valign="top">This is a perfect illustration of what this challenge is all about. The style and form of life in the country. In voting I believe you matyy be suffering from your composition not quite making the most of the subject. We need to get interested in the subject but it''s a bit too far away to see any detail. We like to be wowed by the image and the centre position of it isn''t the best placing. Use the Rule of Thirds if you can.</td>', 'This is a perfect illustration of what this challenge is all about. The style and form of life in the country. In voting I believe you matyy be suffering from your composition not quite making the most of the subject. We need to get interested in the subject but it''s a bit too far away to see any detail. We like to be wowed by the image and the centre position of it isn''t the best placing. Use the Rule of Thirds if you can.', '2006-02-17 23:25:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2160247, 294824, 24528, '<td valign="top">Pole and wires destract from picture</td>', 'Pole and wires destract from picture', '2006-02-17 23:39:14.000000', NULL, 1),
