(2161774, 293012, 3032, '<td valign="top">What do they call them, kottbular? Taste good.<br/>Nice composition and light (altough I''d try to fill the shadows with a reflector). The meatballs are a bit out of context. On a plate or in a pan they''d be more naturally presented.</td>', 'What do they call them, kottbular? Taste good.Nice composition and light (altough I''d try to fill the shadows with a reflector). The meatballs are a bit out of context. On a plate or in a pan they''d be more naturally presented.', '2006-02-18 18:11:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2161780, 294159, 3032, '<td valign="top">Cool b&amp;w, great background with those white and grey shades on the mountain and in the sky. Good that the blond one is standing in front, it stands out well and manages to draw the eye to the underside of the photo. If it were as dark as the other two the eye would wander off to the background (less impact). 8</td>', 'Cool b&w, great background with those white and grey shades on the mountain and in the sky. Good that the blond one is standing in front, it stands out well and manages to draw the eye to the underside of the photo. If it were as dark as the other two the eye would wander off to the background (less impact). 8', '2006-02-18 18:15:45.000000', NULL, 1),
