(2161795, 294983, 47852, '<td valign="top">Woody looks so sad :(  The focal point of this shot seems a bit low.. almost out of the picture.  Great idea though!</td>', 'Woody looks so sad :(  The focal point of this shot seems a bit low.. almost out of the picture.  Great idea though!', '2006-02-18 18:26:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2161800, 294342, 45316, '<td valign="top">Good one!</td>', 'Good one!', '2006-02-18 18:31:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2161802, 294953, 18080, '<td valign="top">first shot that has said country life to me.<br/>10<br/>good luck<br/> <br/>Kev</td>', 'first shot that has said country life to me.10good luck Kev', '2006-02-18 18:31:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2161804, 292158, 47852, '<td valign="top">I think the focal point, the fences, get lost in the trees here.  I like the way you tried to frame this one though with the grass.</td>', 'I think the focal point, the fences, get lost in the trees here.  I like the way you tried to frame this one though with the grass.', '2006-02-18 18:34:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2161806, 294436, 45316, '<td valign="top">Love the colours and the atmosphere. The circle made by the reflection from the bridge, also catch my eye.</td>', 'Love the colours and the atmosphere. The circle made by the reflection from the bridge, also catch my eye.', '2006-02-18 18:35:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2161811, 294952, 47852, '<td valign="top">Looks like a neat spot with the creek and the fences... but the picture is a bit too small to really see the details.</td>', 'Looks like a neat spot with the creek and the fences... but the picture is a bit too small to really see the details.', '2006-02-18 18:38:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2161819, 294267, 45316, '<td valign="top">phooey! That cat need washing!  Good moment capture.</td>', 'phooey! That cat need washing!  Good moment capture.', '2006-02-18 18:42:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2161825, 294512, 45316, '<td valign="top">Where is this? There is another pic in this challenge from this spot.  Nice picture!</td>', 'Where is this? There is another pic in this challenge from this spot.  Nice picture!', '2006-02-18 18:47:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2161827, 294288, 47852, '<td valign="top">The sign sticks out just a bit too much with the desaturation of the rest of the shot.  But, it definately captures the essence of life in the country!</td>', 'The sign sticks out just a bit too much with the desaturation of the rest of the shot.  But, it definately captures the essence of life in the country!', '2006-02-18 18:48:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2161828, 293157, 45316, '<td valign="top">It need something more...</td>', 'It need something more...', '2006-02-18 18:48:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2161832, 294425, 47852, '<td valign="top">Cute title... I never thought of the cows as lawn mowers before.  Love the open feel of this shot!</td>', 'Cute title... I never thought of the cows as lawn mowers before.  Love the open feel of this shot!', '2006-02-18 18:53:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2161834, 294159, 45316, '<td valign="top">Flott þessi!</td>', 'Flott þessi!', '2006-02-18 18:54:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2161838, 294882, 47852, '<td valign="top">Nice composition here, but overall a bit dark.</td>', 'Nice composition here, but overall a bit dark.', '2006-02-18 18:55:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2161843, 294392, 47852, '<td valign="top">I think the best part of this shot is the way the grass goes from green to brown... it just wouldn''t be as good if it were all one color.</td>', 'I think the best part of this shot is the way the grass goes from green to brown... it just wouldn''t be as good if it were all one color.', '2006-02-18 18:59:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2161848, 294824, 47852, '<td valign="top">Foreground looks a bit cluttered and busy... it''s too bad you couldn''t get on the other side of that fence for this shot.  Definately a good representation of country life!</td>', 'Foreground looks a bit cluttered and busy... it''s too bad you couldn''t get on the other side of that fence for this shot.  Definately a good representation of country life!', '2006-02-18 19:03:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2161851, 293489, 45316, '<td valign="top">Beautiful! Both picture and model!</td>', 'Beautiful! Both picture and model!', '2006-02-18 19:04:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2161859, 294971, 47852, '<td valign="top">I like how you captured the ''Twin Pines Ranch'' sign on the left.  Not only does it look neat with the sky peeking through, it gives a sense of life to the place.</td>', 'I like how you captured the ''Twin Pines Ranch'' sign on the left.  Not only does it look neat with the sky peeking through, it gives a sense of life to the place.', '2006-02-18 19:06:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2162004, 294323, 41675, '<td valign="top">If your image had another element, like a piece of bread with some of the spread and a knife, it would add interest, at least for me.</td>', 'If your image had another element, like a piece of bread with some of the spread and a knife, it would add interest, at least for me.', '2006-02-18 20:37:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2162006, 294966, 41675, '<td valign="top">I''ve looked at your image for a few minutes now. It''s not a bad photo by any means, but there''s nothing in it that really jumps out at me and makes me say, "wow." Perhaps it''s the large over hanging branch that''s obscuring the mountain. My favorite part of your image is the sky and trees in the upper right.</td>', 'I''ve looked at your image for a few minutes now. It''s not a bad photo by any means, but there''s nothing in it that really jumps out at me and makes me say, "wow." Perhaps it''s the large over hanging branch that''s obscuring the mountain. My favorite part of your image is the sky and trees in the upper right.', '2006-02-18 20:41:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2162009, 294268, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like the angle and composition. Had there been more light I would have scored it higher. The black sunken ditch keeps drawing my attention away from other parts of your image.</td>', 'I like the angle and composition. Had there been more light I would have scored it higher. The black sunken ditch keeps drawing my attention away from other parts of your image.', '2006-02-18 20:43:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2162011, 294896, 41675, '<td valign="top">When I look at your photo, my eyes are constantly drawn back to the foregroundand the high contrast fence. This takes me away from the subject of your image which is the "old farm." The wooded area is als very busy and in a way, at least for me, seems to "fight" for attention with the foreground fence.</td>', 'When I look at your photo, my eyes are constantly drawn back to the foregroundand the high contrast fence. This takes me away from the subject of your image which is the "old farm." The wooded area is als very busy and in a way, at least for me, seems to "fight" for attention with the foreground fence.', '2006-02-18 20:45:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2162012, 294171, 41675, '<td valign="top">Not a bad road shot although the sky seems overly saturated to me. I like the composition.</td>', 'Not a bad road shot although the sky seems overly saturated to me. I like the composition.', '2006-02-18 20:47:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2162016, 294904, 41675, '<td valign="top">Your title made me smile. For me, I would have found it more interesting if the silos were more off centered and out of the "dead" center. Perhaps showing only one side or the other of the red buildings, but not just a little of both.</td>', 'Your title made me smile. For me, I would have found it more interesting if the silos were more off centered and out of the "dead" center. Perhaps showing only one side or the other of the red buildings, but not just a little of both.', '2006-02-18 20:49:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2162017, 294692, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like the sepia tone - gives your photo an old-world kind of feel...nostalgic. Bumping up after a second, longer look.</td>', 'I like the sepia tone - gives your photo an old-world kind of feel...nostalgic. Bumping up after a second, longer look.', '2006-02-18 20:50:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2162030, 294022, 41675, '<td valign="top">My favorite part of your image is how I see the ice along the shore and the shapes of the branches are similar. My least favorite part is the very top with the houses.</td>', 'My favorite part of your image is how I see the ice along the shore and the shapes of the branches are similar. My least favorite part is the very top with the houses.', '2006-02-18 20:58:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2162032, 294945, 41675, '<td valign="top">Now, if you had been able to catch a beaver in this shot as well, I would have bumped it up a point or two. For me, it needs another element or object to keep me interested.</td>', 'Now, if you had been able to catch a beaver in this shot as well, I would have bumped it up a point or two. For me, it needs another element or object to keep me interested.', '2006-02-18 20:59:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2162035, 294620, 41675, '<td valign="top">I''d be curious to see the original before post-processing. It''s a little over the top on the whites and highlights for my personal taste, but nice composition.</td>', 'I''d be curious to see the original before post-processing. It''s a little over the top on the whites and highlights for my personal taste, but nice composition.', '2006-02-18 21:00:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2162037, 294836, 41675, '<td valign="top">Tee hee. Your title makes me chuckle. Your image is appearing pixelated on my screen. Had it been a bit crisper and maybe more saturation I would have scored it higher.</td>', 'Tee hee. Your title makes me chuckle. Your image is appearing pixelated on my screen. Had it been a bit crisper and maybe more saturation I would have scored it higher.', '2006-02-18 21:01:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2162064, 294447, 41675, '<td valign="top">I think your image is nice. It just seems to lack something to make it pop out for the viewer. Perhaps a different angle and less grain. When I look at your photo my eyes go from the tree on the left to the one in the middle and then to the one on the far right side, and the barn itself seems to get lost, but that''s just how I look at it.</td>', 'I think your image is nice. It just seems to lack something to make it pop out for the viewer. Perhaps a different angle and less grain. When I look at your photo my eyes go from the tree on the left to the one in the middle and then to the one on the far right side, and the barn itself seems to get lost, but that''s just how I look at it.', '2006-02-18 21:12:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2162068, 294831, 41675, '<td valign="top">It''s a nice photo of an old car. I like the highlights and tigh composition, but for me personally, it doesn''t say "country life."</td>', 'It''s a nice photo of an old car. I like the highlights and tigh composition, but for me personally, it doesn''t say "country life."', '2006-02-18 21:13:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2162082, 293726, 41675, '<td valign="top">While there''s nothing truly bad about your photo, for me, the subject matter doesn''t hold my interest as well as other entries. I think it might be in part the large foliage on the left and the overall blue tone (although I know this is twilight). Sorry, I''m not more technical.</td>', 'While there''s nothing truly bad about your photo, for me, the subject matter doesn''t hold my interest as well as other entries. I think it might be in part the large foliage on the left and the overall blue tone (although I know this is twilight). Sorry, I''m not more technical.', '2006-02-18 21:16:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2162093, 294952, 41675, '<td valign="top">Personally, I always like to see an image that is close to the maximum allowed 640 pixels. Gives me a good overall sense for the photo. The upper middle portion of your shot seems most interesting, but again, I really wish it was larger.</td>', 'Personally, I always like to see an image that is close to the maximum allowed 640 pixels. Gives me a good overall sense for the photo. The upper middle portion of your shot seems most interesting, but again, I really wish it was larger.', '2006-02-18 21:17:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2162096, 294965, 52628, '<td valign="top">Yes, lighthouses do reside in the countryside! :)  I do want to see more of the sea and a bit less sky, but good image anyway.</td>', 'Yes, lighthouses do reside in the countryside! :)  I do want to see more of the sea and a bit less sky, but good image anyway.', '2006-02-18 21:18:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2162101, 294703, 41675, '<td valign="top">When I first looked at your image, I cocked my head sideways to match your horizon. I think if your photo was rotated a bit counter-clockwise and maybe a bit less red or stronger whites on the snow, this would be a great shot.</td>', 'When I first looked at your image, I cocked my head sideways to match your horizon. I think if your photo was rotated a bit counter-clockwise and maybe a bit less red or stronger whites on the snow, this would be a great shot.', '2006-02-18 21:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2162110, 294877, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like the contrasting colors. It took my eyes a moment to realize what it was. I wonder how this would look if you pulled back just a bit, letting the viewer see more of the grain/stalk. Good natural lighting and colors though</td>', 'I like the contrasting colors. It took my eyes a moment to realize what it was. I wonder how this would look if you pulled back just a bit, letting the viewer see more of the grain/stalk. Good natural lighting and colors though', '2006-02-18 21:20:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2162116, 293067, 41675, '<td valign="top">Your flash appears a bit harsh. A different lighting source might produce a better result.</td>', 'Your flash appears a bit harsh. A different lighting source might produce a better result.', '2006-02-18 21:21:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2162122, 294541, 41675, '<td valign="top">While I think your image fits the challenge it seems overly processed and too black, but then again, I''m not a big fan of the grunge look that seems to have taken hold here at DPC.</td>', 'While I think your image fits the challenge it seems overly processed and too black, but then again, I''m not a big fan of the grunge look that seems to have taken hold here at DPC.', '2006-02-18 21:22:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2162123, 294173, 52628, '<td valign="top">has potential but  appears too grey for me.</td>', 'has potential but  appears too grey for me.', '2006-02-18 21:22:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2162124, 293489, 41675, '<td valign="top">Good portrait and pose. the skin tones seem a bit off. Especially the high key yellow area around her right eye and brow.</td>', 'Good portrait and pose. the skin tones seem a bit off. Especially the high key yellow area around her right eye and brow.', '2006-02-18 21:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2162127, 294882, 41675, '<td valign="top">It took my eyes a moment to recognize the cowboy hat. For me, had there been a bit more light and definition along the brim, I would have scored it better.</td>', 'It took my eyes a moment to recognize the cowboy hat. For me, had there been a bit more light and definition along the brim, I would have scored it better.', '2006-02-18 21:23:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2162133, 294841, 52628, '<td valign="top">Very good exposure!  One of the best yet.</td>', 'Very good exposure!  One of the best yet.', '2006-02-18 21:24:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2162138, 294591, 52628, '<td valign="top">Nice colours.</td>', 'Nice colours.', '2006-02-18 21:25:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2162141, 292639, 41675, '<td valign="top">The structure is interesting. I think if it were cropped out a bit more from the bottom and maybe not quite so...orange on the land it would be a more effective and interesting image.</td>', 'The structure is interesting. I think if it were cropped out a bit more from the bottom and maybe not quite so...orange on the land it would be a more effective and interesting image.', '2006-02-18 21:25:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2162148, 294191, 41675, '<td valign="top">Great back yard! I''m envious. The structure in the background adds interest, too bad winter produces such drab colors though.</td>', 'Great back yard! I''m envious. The structure in the background adds interest, too bad winter produces such drab colors though.', '2006-02-18 21:26:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2162152, 293045, 52628, '<td valign="top">Great light here!  Like the composition.</td>', 'Great light here!  Like the composition.', '2006-02-18 21:27:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2162153, 294696, 41675, '<td valign="top">For me, if you cropped more from either the top or bottom of your image to remove the horizon from the "dead" center, it would be more effective. The foreground doesn''t hold my interest much, but I like the field in the middle and the sky.</td>', 'For me, if you cropped more from either the top or bottom of your image to remove the horizon from the "dead" center, it would be more effective. The foreground doesn''t hold my interest much, but I like the field in the middle and the sky.', '2006-02-18 21:28:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2162159, 294756, 47294, '<td valign="top">What a stunning shot, WOW! 9 and good luck!</td>', 'What a stunning shot, WOW! 9 and good luck!', '2006-02-18 21:29:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2162160, 294725, 41675, '<td valign="top">Overall I like your photo. My favorite part is the middle section with the leaves and fruit. The ladder adds interest for me as well. My least favorite part is the sky in the upper right.</td>', 'Overall I like your photo. My favorite part is the middle section with the leaves and fruit. The ladder adds interest for me as well. My least favorite part is the sky in the upper right.', '2006-02-18 21:29:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2162163, 293910, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like the duck on the left. I wish the one on the right wasn''t covered by the twigs, but I know you couldn''t help that.</td>', 'I like the duck on the left. I wish the one on the right wasn''t covered by the twigs, but I know you couldn''t help that.', '2006-02-18 21:29:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2162167, 293893, 34309, '<td valign="top">What an awesome place. I wish it was mine:)<br/>Beautiful and far away from everything!!</td>', 'What an awesome place. I wish it was mine:)Beautiful and far away from everything!!', '2006-02-18 21:30:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2162168, 294867, 41675, '<td valign="top">My favorite part of your image is the upper 2/3rds. The very bottom is a bit dark, but overall a nice photo.</td>', 'My favorite part of your image is the upper 2/3rds. The very bottom is a bit dark, but overall a nice photo.', '2006-02-18 21:30:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2162173, 292990, 41675, '<td valign="top">Tee hee. I like your composition. Unfortunately, my eyes keep getting drawn to that orange area in the top left and I really find it detracts from an otherwise good photo.</td>', 'Tee hee. I like your composition. Unfortunately, my eyes keep getting drawn to that orange area in the top left and I really find it detracts from an otherwise good photo.', '2006-02-18 21:31:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2162175, 293952, 34309, '<td valign="top">I absolutely love this one!!!!<br/>Not only because of nice colour of the sky and everything else but because this picture take me to a place I''ll never find though I''ve been looking for my whole life.<br/>Peaceful, silent and so beautiful. It brings so much comfort when I look at it. It''s my favourite. Thanks for submitting it:)<br/>10 out of 10</td>', 'I absolutely love this one!!!!Not only because of nice colour of the sky and everything else but because this picture take me to a place I''ll never find though I''ve been looking for my whole life.Peaceful, silent and so beautiful. It brings so much comfort when I look at it. It''s my favourite. Thanks for submitting it:)10 out of 10', '2006-02-18 21:32:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2162178, 293469, 41675, '<td valign="top">Since winter and cold produce such drab colors, I wonder how this would look as a black and white or sepia image. Black and white might give it a nice, nostalgic feel - just a thought.</td>', 'Since winter and cold produce such drab colors, I wonder how this would look as a black and white or sepia image. Black and white might give it a nice, nostalgic feel - just a thought.', '2006-02-18 21:32:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2162181, 294589, 52628, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!</td>', 'Beautiful!', '2006-02-18 21:33:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2162183, 293793, 41675, '<td valign="top">Had it not been for those tall thin branches in the foreground, I would have scored this even higher. I really like the lighting on the roof and trees on the right.</td>', 'Had it not been for those tall thin branches in the foreground, I would have scored this even higher. I really like the lighting on the roof and trees on the right.', '2006-02-18 21:33:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2162187, 294886, 34309, '<td valign="top">I think it''s a bit oversaturated... sorry</td>', 'I think it''s a bit oversaturated... sorry', '2006-02-18 21:34:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2162188, 294922, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like the simplicity of your composition. I find it refreshing. Good sky. A bit of pixelation around the weathervane, but overall I like it. Bumping up after a second look.</td>', 'I like the simplicity of your composition. I find it refreshing. Good sky. A bit of pixelation around the weathervane, but overall I like it. Bumping up after a second look.', '2006-02-18 21:34:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2162192, 294285, 41675, '<td valign="top">Your photo made me smile. Funny sign.</td>', 'Your photo made me smile. Funny sign.', '2006-02-18 21:35:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2162196, 294383, 41675, '<td valign="top">Great sky! Fabulous blue color. Personally, I wonder how this would look if the tree on the left were cropped out and it wasn''t so black at the very bottom.</td>', 'Great sky! Fabulous blue color. Personally, I wonder how this would look if the tree on the left were cropped out and it wasn''t so black at the very bottom.', '2006-02-18 21:36:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2162208, 292158, 41675, '<td valign="top">For me, there really isn''t one main focal point in your image, but it gives me an odd voyouer sense. Like I''m a hunter waiting for the deer or a Civil War soldier waiting for the enemy to come over the crest. I like that about your photo - how it makes me feel, not necessarily the visual aspect of it.</td>', 'For me, there really isn''t one main focal point in your image, but it gives me an odd voyouer sense. Like I''m a hunter waiting for the deer or a Civil War soldier waiting for the enemy to come over the crest. I like that about your photo - how it makes me feel, not necessarily the visual aspect of it.', '2006-02-18 21:38:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2162216, 294919, 41675, '<td valign="top">For me, this is a nice photo. There''s nothing bad about that I can see, but there''s also nothing in it that makes me say wow or holds my interest for long. Sorry, I''m not good at the technical aspects.</td>', 'For me, this is a nice photo. There''s nothing bad about that I can see, but there''s also nothing in it that makes me say wow or holds my interest for long. Sorry, I''m not good at the technical aspects.', '2006-02-18 21:39:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2162217, 294956, 41675, '<td valign="top">Good country tree and nice clouds in the sky. Had there been a child hanging off the branches or a couple of people for added interest, I would have scored it higher.</td>', 'Good country tree and nice clouds in the sky. Had there been a child hanging off the branches or a couple of people for added interest, I would have scored it higher.', '2006-02-18 21:40:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2162222, 293157, 52628, '<td valign="top">I like the minimal approach on this one.</td>', 'I like the minimal approach on this one.', '2006-02-18 21:42:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2162242, 294756, 33732, '<td valign="top">The sky is so interesting.</td>', 'The sky is so interesting.', '2006-02-18 21:53:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2162246, 293952, 33732, '<td valign="top">That blue is nice.  The weathered hay seems dark.</td>', 'That blue is nice.  The weathered hay seems dark.', '2006-02-18 21:55:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2162259, 293585, 33732, '<td valign="top">This is a stunning. I will check on this later.</td>', 'This is a stunning. I will check on this later.', '2006-02-18 21:59:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2162267, 294603, 33732, '<td valign="top">Not so sharp.  Interesting.</td>', 'Not so sharp.  Interesting.', '2006-02-18 22:02:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2162323, 294959, 39663, '<td valign="top">would make great etching!</td>', 'would make great etching!', '2006-02-18 22:19:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2162352, 294162, 47852, '<td valign="top">This is the best kind of snow... it sticks to everything and looks beautiful.  I like the little details that you kept in here like the birdhouse and the mailbox flag.  Gives a real sense of someone living here without having any people here.  The really dark fencepost right in the center seems a little overwhelming, but otherwise a nice shot.</td>', 'This is the best kind of snow... it sticks to everything and looks beautiful.  I like the little details that you kept in here like the birdhouse and the mailbox flag.  Gives a real sense of someone living here without having any people here.  The really dark fencepost right in the center seems a little overwhelming, but otherwise a nice shot.', '2006-02-18 22:30:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2162357, 293786, 47852, '<td valign="top">A neat shot with all of the lines of fencing and horses.  Unfortunately, it''s a bit too small to really be able to appreciate all of the details.</td>', 'A neat shot with all of the lines of fencing and horses.  Unfortunately, it''s a bit too small to really be able to appreciate all of the details.', '2006-02-18 22:31:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2162375, 292347, 47852, '<td valign="top">Nicely captured, but it appears as though you did some processing to it which I find distracting.  The line around the edge where the blurring begins keeps catching my attention and drawing it away from the church.  While I like the soft feel you were going for overall, I think I may have preferred less editing.</td>', 'Nicely captured, but it appears as though you did some processing to it which I find distracting.  The line around the edge where the blurring begins keeps catching my attention and drawing it away from the church.  While I like the soft feel you were going for overall, I think I may have preferred less editing.', '2006-02-18 22:35:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2162392, 294290, 34309, '<td valign="top">So that''s how they do that!!!!:)</td>', 'So that''s how they do that!!!!:)', '2006-02-18 22:39:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2162413, 294756, 35970, '<td valign="top">beautiful...</td>', 'beautiful...', '2006-02-18 22:47:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2162436, 294951, 34309, '<td valign="top">Great colours, sharpness and very nice composition.<br/>The snow looks blueish:/ is it meant to be like this??<br/>I really like this picture:)</td>', 'Great colours, sharpness and very nice composition.The snow looks blueish:/ is it meant to be like this??I really like this picture:)', '2006-02-18 22:55:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2162447, 294643, 34309, '<td valign="top">Very nice:)</td>', 'Very nice:)', '2006-02-18 22:58:35.000000', NULL, 1),
