(2163385, 293157, 47852, '<td valign="top">I wish there were something here to give a sense of scale.  Definately an interesting and unique shot with a vibrant color!</td>', 'I wish there were something here to give a sense of scale.  Definately an interesting and unique shot with a vibrant color!', '2006-02-19 14:20:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2163391, 294692, 47852, '<td valign="top">Great composition here, and the tones are calm and relaxing.  Interesting border you used... definately better than a plain white or black.  Very well done.</td>', 'Great composition here, and the tones are calm and relaxing.  Interesting border you used... definately better than a plain white or black.  Very well done.', '2006-02-19 14:22:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2163392, 294139, 47852, '<td valign="top">Wow!  Love the different textures here with the soft clouds and the gritty hillside.  My first reaction was that the tractor didn''t really belong right in the center, but after looking at it for a while, I kind of like it there! :)  Very well done!</td>', 'Wow!  Love the different textures here with the soft clouds and the gritty hillside.  My first reaction was that the tractor didn''t really belong right in the center, but after looking at it for a while, I kind of like it there! :)  Very well done!', '2006-02-19 14:23:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2163393, 294171, 47852, '<td valign="top">Love the wide open space here with the mountains in the background.  Well done! :)</td>', 'Love the wide open space here with the mountains in the background.  Well done! :)', '2006-02-19 14:23:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2163394, 294175, 47852, '<td valign="top">Great angle and composition here.  What a cute shot! :)</td>', 'Great angle and composition here.  What a cute shot! :)', '2006-02-19 14:23:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2163396, 293900, 47852, '<td valign="top">Sometimes it''s the little details that make a shot.. like the overall strap and the piece of straw sticking out of his mouth.  A lovely silhouette.  Well done!</td>', 'Sometimes it''s the little details that make a shot.. like the overall strap and the piece of straw sticking out of his mouth.  A lovely silhouette.  Well done!', '2006-02-19 14:23:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2163397, 294582, 47852, '<td valign="top">The hillside behind the farm makes a great background for this shot.  It feels like the building are too centered.  Perhaps if you cropped a bit more from the left and showed a little more of the field on the right?  That space behind the barn looks like it drops off the side of the hill.  Overall, a great shot though!  Nice job!</td>', 'The hillside behind the farm makes a great background for this shot.  It feels like the building are too centered.  Perhaps if you cropped a bit more from the left and showed a little more of the field on the right?  That space behind the barn looks like it drops off the side of the hill.  Overall, a great shot though!  Nice job!', '2006-02-19 14:23:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2163398, 294685, 47852, '<td valign="top">WOW!  What an expression!  Those eyes just suck you right in.  Well done!</td>', 'WOW!  What an expression!  Those eyes just suck you right in.  Well done!', '2006-02-19 14:23:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2163399, 294603, 47852, '<td valign="top">Looks like a quaint little town you''ve captured here!  Love the depth of the mountains too.  It seems as though the back mountain is a bit bright and the houses are a bit dark.  Would there be a way to even them out just a little?  Great job! :)</td>', 'Looks like a quaint little town you''ve captured here!  Love the depth of the mountains too.  It seems as though the back mountain is a bit bright and the houses are a bit dark.  Would there be a way to even them out just a little?  Great job! :)', '2006-02-19 14:23:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2163400, 294884, 47852, '<td valign="top">Wow.. what scale.  From the huge mountain and tall trees all the way down to the person sitting outside.  Well done!</td>', 'Wow.. what scale.  From the huge mountain and tall trees all the way down to the person sitting outside.  Well done!', '2006-02-19 14:23:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2163401, 294268, 47852, '<td valign="top">Love the lines here with the road and fences... pulls you right back into the houses.  The falling snow adds a neat touch too.</td>', 'Love the lines here with the road and fences... pulls you right back into the houses.  The falling snow adds a neat touch too.', '2006-02-19 14:23:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2163402, 294656, 47852, '<td valign="top">Interesting angle... I''m not sure that so much foreground is needed here.  I love the softness of the background and the colors here.  Nicely done!</td>', 'Interesting angle... I''m not sure that so much foreground is needed here.  I love the softness of the background and the colors here.  Nicely done!', '2006-02-19 14:23:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2163405, 294922, 47852, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed... and I like the softness of the clouds here.  Well done!</td>', 'Nicely composed... and I like the softness of the clouds here.  Well done!', '2006-02-19 14:24:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2163406, 294290, 47852, '<td valign="top">Eww!  Cute shot though.  Definately depicts every day country living! :)</td>', 'Eww!  Cute shot though.  Definately depicts every day country living! :)', '2006-02-19 14:24:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2163407, 294007, 47852, '<td valign="top">Fantastic job capturing the essence of this challenge.  Nice framing with the tree on the left.  Only criticism is that the colors seem a bit dull.</td>', 'Fantastic job capturing the essence of this challenge.  Nice framing with the tree on the left.  Only criticism is that the colors seem a bit dull.', '2006-02-19 14:24:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2163408, 293585, 47852, '<td valign="top">Great clarity and colors here!  Fun shot! :)</td>', 'Great clarity and colors here!  Fun shot! :)', '2006-02-19 14:24:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2163409, 294661, 47852, '<td valign="top">Wow.. it looks like he''s ready to lick the camera!  What an angle! :)  Nicely done!</td>', 'Wow.. it looks like he''s ready to lick the camera!  What an angle! :)  Nicely done!', '2006-02-19 14:24:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2163410, 293562, 47852, '<td valign="top">Love the vibrant colors here.  Just bold enough but they don''t look over processed.  Nicely done!</td>', 'Love the vibrant colors here.  Just bold enough but they don''t look over processed.  Nicely done!', '2006-02-19 14:24:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2163411, 294173, 47852, '<td valign="top">Nice line of the trees heading off.  A very peaceful shot. :)</td>', 'Nice line of the trees heading off.  A very peaceful shot. :)', '2006-02-19 14:24:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2163412, 294636, 47852, '<td valign="top">What a fun shot!  Great capture of the moment with these kids... every single one of them has a huge smile on their face! :)</td>', 'What a fun shot!  Great capture of the moment with these kids... every single one of them has a huge smile on their face! :)', '2006-02-19 14:24:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2163414, 294250, 47852, '<td valign="top">Her face is a bit bright... but what an expression and capture you have here! :)</td>', 'Her face is a bit bright... but what an expression and capture you have here! :)', '2006-02-19 14:25:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2163415, 293952, 47852, '<td valign="top">Love the wide open sky and the large rolls... makes the person look small in comparison.  The sky looks a little bit too blue, and even the hay and jeans look like they''ve taken on a bit too much of a bluish tint.  Great capture of the feeling of the country!</td>', 'Love the wide open sky and the large rolls... makes the person look small in comparison.  The sky looks a little bit too blue, and even the hay and jeans look like they''ve taken on a bit too much of a bluish tint.  Great capture of the feeling of the country!', '2006-02-19 14:25:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2163416, 294657, 47852, '<td valign="top">This barn looks like it would have a lot of stories to tell considering how weathered it is.  Great textures and lines here!</td>', 'This barn looks like it would have a lot of stories to tell considering how weathered it is.  Great textures and lines here!', '2006-02-19 14:25:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2163417, 294865, 47852, '<td valign="top">Great idea and nice attention to detail in your authentic setup (room, stove, books, clothing etc.)  Something is missing here for me though, and I can''t figure out what.  It seems a bit flat... the angle?  Lighting?  I''m not sure.  Still, a great job capturing the essence of the challenge!</td>', 'Great idea and nice attention to detail in your authentic setup (room, stove, books, clothing etc.)  Something is missing here for me though, and I can''t figure out what.  It seems a bit flat... the angle?  Lighting?  I''m not sure.  Still, a great job capturing the essence of the challenge!', '2006-02-19 14:25:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2163418, 294792, 47852, '<td valign="top">Poor guy looks pretty unhappy about that!  Great capture of day to day activities... perfect for this challenge.</td>', 'Poor guy looks pretty unhappy about that!  Great capture of day to day activities... perfect for this challenge.', '2006-02-19 14:25:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2163419, 294112, 47852, '<td valign="top">Simple shot.. love the textures on the post and the rusted wire.</td>', 'Simple shot.. love the textures on the post and the rusted wire.', '2006-02-19 14:25:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2163420, 294875, 47852, '<td valign="top">Great angle and lighting here.  I also like the rusted textures.  Nice job!</td>', 'Great angle and lighting here.  I also like the rusted textures.  Nice job!', '2006-02-19 14:25:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2163421, 293212, 47852, '<td valign="top">Clever take on the challenge!  Most city-folk don''t get to see and appreciate things like this!  Well done!</td>', 'Clever take on the challenge!  Most city-folk don''t get to see and appreciate things like this!  Well done!', '2006-02-19 14:26:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2163422, 294102, 47852, '<td valign="top">Adorable!  Neat composition with the straight piece of wood and the round barrel... but you just keep getting sucked back into that cute little face staring at you!</td>', 'Adorable!  Neat composition with the straight piece of wood and the round barrel... but you just keep getting sucked back into that cute little face staring at you!', '2006-02-19 14:26:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2163423, 294899, 47852, '<td valign="top">Love the warm colors of the field and truck.  Nicely done!</td>', 'Love the warm colors of the field and truck.  Nicely done!', '2006-02-19 14:26:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2163425, 292395, 47852, '<td valign="top">Very authentic depiction of country life.  Love the angled fences of the bridge too.  Nice job!</td>', 'Very authentic depiction of country life.  Love the angled fences of the bridge too.  Nice job!', '2006-02-19 14:26:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2163434, 292627, 48545, '<td valign="top">Nice use of duotone, beautiful white horse.  There isn''t a huge wow factor going on in this photo though, therefore guessing mid-table</td>', 'Nice use of duotone, beautiful white horse.  There isn''t a huge wow factor going on in this photo though, therefore guessing mid-table', '2006-02-19 14:35:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2163441, 294578, 48545, '<td valign="top">I think this photo is trying to be too many things and due to this each is removing the relevance of the other.  The sky is nice and moody and almost over powers the amazing mountains, whilst the balcony just seems a little out of place.  Wouldn''t mind supping a cold beer here though!</td>', 'I think this photo is trying to be too many things and due to this each is removing the relevance of the other.  The sky is nice and moody and almost over powers the amazing mountains, whilst the balcony just seems a little out of place.  Wouldn''t mind supping a cold beer here though!', '2006-02-19 14:42:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2163443, 294844, 16241, '<td valign="top">sweet picture!</td>', 'sweet picture!', '2006-02-19 14:43:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2163444, 294957, 16241, '<td valign="top">great!</td>', 'great!', '2006-02-19 14:43:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2163448, 294815, 16241, '<td valign="top">nice!</td>', 'nice!', '2006-02-19 14:45:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2163449, 294395, 48545, '<td valign="top">The leading lines are nice, however the dog is too small to be a main subject and the photo has a snap shot feel to it.   The canopy is nice and frames the path and photo nicely.</td>', 'The leading lines are nice, however the dog is too small to be a main subject and the photo has a snap shot feel to it.   The canopy is nice and frames the path and photo nicely.', '2006-02-19 14:45:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2163473, 293469, 33061, '<td valign="top">Nice subject matter with the dilapidated, run-down house. I think from a different angle this might have been a better shot, simply because the tree to the right, along with all the trees in the background, give this picture a very busy feel (at least for me)</td>', 'Nice subject matter with the dilapidated, run-down house. I think from a different angle this might have been a better shot, simply because the tree to the right, along with all the trees in the background, give this picture a very busy feel (at least for me)', '2006-02-19 15:09:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2163477, 294793, 33061, '<td valign="top">good composition and nice setup. The lower part of the sky seems a bit over exposed...might be just my laptop screen though.</td>', 'good composition and nice setup. The lower part of the sky seems a bit over exposed...might be just my laptop screen though.', '2006-02-19 15:10:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2163558, 294159, 46853, '<td valign="top">Like the cold tone of this one.  And I like the Icelandic  horse.</td>', 'Like the cold tone of this one.  And I like the Icelandic  horse.', '2006-02-19 16:01:11.000000', NULL, 1),
