(2163723, 294636, 41746, '<td valign="top">My favorite photo in the challenge. So full of life and happiness. Love the texture and the tone of colors. This one deserves the blue ribbon. 10.</td>', 'My favorite photo in the challenge. So full of life and happiness. Love the texture and the tone of colors. This one deserves the blue ribbon. 10.', '2006-02-19 17:34:42.000000', NULL, 1),
