(2164055, 294023, 6519, '<td valign="top">I love the way the various lines lead my eyes zig-zagging through the photo.<br/>It is a very pretty rural scene, and I''m dying to find out where in the world it is THAT green in February. It''s not a tropical scene... southern Europe, perhaps? Hmm......</td>', 'I love the way the various lines lead my eyes zig-zagging through the photo.It is a very pretty rural scene, and I''m dying to find out where in the world it is THAT green in February. It''s not a tropical scene... southern Europe, perhaps? Hmm......', '2006-02-19 20:34:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2164065, 294384, 35804, '<td valign="top">...oh!...well done...the repetition and textures are quite nice.</td>', '...oh!...well done...the repetition and textures are quite nice.', '2006-02-19 20:41:42.000000', NULL, 1),
