(2164814, 294499, 6349, '<td valign="top">Seems I''m always adding your photographs to my favorites before I even know whose they are.  This was way underrated.  It was one of few in the challenge that depicted life as in living as in a human being doing more than just standing there.  To me that is what the challenge was all about plus the lines are just so darn interesting.</td>', 'Seems I''m always adding your photographs to my favorites before I even know whose they are.  This was way underrated.  It was one of few in the challenge that depicted life as in living as in a human being doing more than just standing there.  To me that is what the challenge was all about plus the lines are just so darn interesting.', '2006-02-20 01:13:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(2164815, 294572, 36988, '<td valign="top">Angela, excellent job. You really captured an amazing image and I couldn''t be happier for you... :)</td>', 'Angela, excellent job. You really captured an amazing image and I couldn''t be happier for you... :)', '2006-02-20 01:13:26.000000', NULL, 0),
