(2165557, 294980, 48245, '<td valign="top">Boy, folks really didn''t like this picture. Guess they felt it didn''t match the theme. I was torn between this picture and the following:<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=294960" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/48245/thumb/294960.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/48245/thumb/294960.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/48245/thumb/294960.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/>I was afraid that it was too underexposed. Both pictures where taken at the same event, the rodeo.<br/> <br/>Oh well, I like the picture ;-)</td>', 'Boy, folks really didn''t like this picture. Guess they felt it didn''t match the theme. I was torn between this picture and the following:   I was afraid that it was too underexposed. Both pictures where taken at the same event, the rodeo. Oh well, I like the picture ;-)', '2006-02-20 11:39:04.000000', NULL, 0),
