(2169044, 293558, 35602, '<td valign="top">I was trying to depict an international style image, and I liked the idea of using a burka. The idea came from a photo book I have, and my hands image is very similar to the one I saw in the book. I felt it had more emotion and said much more. I am sorry that nobody appreciates the contrast used, the tones, or the strength of this image.</td>', 'I was trying to depict an international style image, and I liked the idea of using a burka. The idea came from a photo book I have, and my hands image is very similar to the one I saw in the book. I felt it had more emotion and said much more. I am sorry that nobody appreciates the contrast used, the tones, or the strength of this image.', '2006-02-21 20:51:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(2169054, 292347, 35602, '<td valign="top">Sorry this did not do better.  The greens are so saturated on this one.  The various green tones really make this photo.  I guess the clarity is what brought it down.  Hope to see more of your entries.  Anyway, mine fared really badly.  184th.  Guess when I don''t pass my images past somebody beforehand, I get bad scores.</td>', 'Sorry this did not do better.  The greens are so saturated on this one.  The various green tones really make this photo.  I guess the clarity is what brought it down.  Hope to see more of your entries.  Anyway, mine fared really badly.  184th.  Guess when I don''t pass my images past somebody beforehand, I get bad scores.', '2006-02-21 20:56:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(2169070, 294685, 35602, '<td valign="top">I think you were robbed.  This is a great image.  Love the way the background mimics the feathers of the owl.  Really clear and precise.  I guess most people failed to see the country connection, but in another challenge, such as birds, it would have probably been in the top 40 at least.</td>', 'I think you were robbed.  This is a great image.  Love the way the background mimics the feathers of the owl.  Really clear and precise.  I guess most people failed to see the country connection, but in another challenge, such as birds, it would have probably been in the top 40 at least.', '2006-02-21 21:01:30.000000', NULL, 0),
