(2190826, 294959, 17937, '<td valign="top">Wow.  I like the color, the contrast and the layout.  Reminds me of a part of a movie where someone''s on a bad trip or something.  Hope thats ok.  Just the first thing that came to my mind...  Very nice job though.</td>', 'Wow.  I like the color, the contrast and the layout.  Reminds me of a part of a movie where someone''s on a bad trip or something.  Hope thats ok.  Just the first thing that came to my mind...  Very nice job though.', '2006-02-28 22:18:38.000000', NULL, 0),
