(2202898, 294572, 30959, '<td valign="top">There''s an old saying that goes something like this "Never squat with your spurs on". Any truth to that? Nice shot.</td>', 'There''s an old saying that goes something like this "Never squat with your spurs on". Any truth to that? Nice shot.', '2006-03-06 00:51:06.000000', NULL, 0),
