(2210080, 294971, 36999, '<td valign="top">Thought this might be in SLV when I voted.  Very nice!</td>', 'Thought this might be in SLV when I voted.  Very nice!', '2006-03-08 05:09:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(2216616, 293562, 28742, '<td valign="top">Well, I failed to comment on this during the challenge. Nothing specific stands out, but it is an overall great image for the feeling you get from it. Very well done.</td>', 'Well, I failed to comment on this during the challenge. Nothing specific stands out, but it is an overall great image for the feeling you get from it. Very well done.', '2006-03-10 07:03:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(2218520, 294882, 51553, '<td valign="top">After reading some of the other comments, I have to say...I think the tones and darkness make the image what it is.  I wouldn''t change a thing.  <br/> <br/>ps. I''m seeing it on a HP 17" LCD monitor.</td>', 'After reading some of the other comments, I have to say...I think the tones and darkness make the image what it is.  I wouldn''t change a thing.   ps. I''m seeing it on a HP 17" LCD monitor.', '2006-03-11 01:26:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(2220074, 294175, 24111, '<td valign="top">Very cool gallery you have and a good eye! Hey, come to the blue ridge, plenty of this stuff here! :)</td>', 'Very cool gallery you have and a good eye! Hey, come to the blue ridge, plenty of this stuff here! :)', '2006-03-11 22:02:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(2227842, 293328, 30861, '<td valign="top">Check out my landscapes portfolio; we have very similar "backyards" and a very similar aesthetic in our owrk with them. I have yet to be in the right place for a misty one, though; mist is hard to come by here on Cape Cod; it''s usually solid fog or clear. Wonderful shot!</td>', 'Check out my landscapes portfolio; we have very similar "backyards" and a very similar aesthetic in our owrk with them. I have yet to be in the right place for a misty one, though; mist is hard to come by here on Cape Cod; it''s usually solid fog or clear. Wonderful shot!', '2006-03-14 18:37:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(2228410, 294657, 42100, '<td valign="top">What a great find, that old building is loaded with character and detail.  A place you''ll have to revisit if possible, especially if you ever have photographer''s block.  Very nice composition and colors.  Very nice!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-03-14 22:54:28.</i></td>', 'What a great find, that old building is loaded with character and detail.  A place you''ll have to revisit if possible, especially if you ever have photographer''s block.  Very nice composition and colors.  Very nice!', '2006-03-14 22:53:59.000000', '2006-03-14 22:54:28.000000', 0),
(2243910, 293562, 43869, '<td valign="top">The colors in this are beautiful!</td>', 'The colors in this are beautiful!', '2006-03-21 09:48:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(2254212, 293069, 30018, '<td valign="top">Nice compostion.  Beautiful colors. I love the softness as it make it feel very dreamy.  Only critizism is the cropping...just a tad too much on top and bottom of image.  Sad you lost the dogs foot and the top of her head.  Otherwise...awesome image!</td>', 'Nice compostion.  Beautiful colors. I love the softness as it make it feel very dreamy.  Only critizism is the cropping...just a tad too much on top and bottom of image.  Sad you lost the dogs foot and the top of her head.  Otherwise...awesome image!', '2006-03-24 07:10:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(2261102, 294620, 36999, '<td valign="top">I liked your outake much better! <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=297457" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/39850/thumb/297457.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/39850/thumb/297457.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/39850/thumb/297457.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/>I scored it a 5.  It''s a nice image but I don''t are much for the PP and I can''t help my bias towards the distortion of the equine.  The wide angle caused his head to look too big for his body and like he might just fall on his face if not for the fence but it wasn''t a big enough distortion to appear as if it was shot that way on purpose.<br/> <br/>Edit; fixed link<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-03-26 21:15:44.</i></td>', 'I liked your outake much better!   I scored it a 5.  It''s a nice image but I don''t are much for the PP and I can''t help my bias towards the distortion of the equine.  The wide angle caused his head to look too big for his body and like he might just fall on his face if not for the fence but it wasn''t a big enough distortion to appear as if it was shot that way on purpose. Edit; fixed link', '2006-03-26 22:13:26.000000', '2006-03-26 22:15:44.000000', 0),
(2261496, 294620, 39850, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Ristyz:</b></div><hr/><i> .. It''s a nice image but I don''t care much for the PP and I can''t help my bias towards the distortion of the equine.  The wide angle caused his head to look too big for his body and like he might just fall on his face if not for the fence but it wasn''t a big enough distortion to appear as if it was shot that way on purpose. ..</i></td></tr></table> <br/>Thank you again (also for another chuckle) - just to clarify, I didn''t use a wide-angle lens, but yes the perspective/angle was quite sharp, intentionally.  A very gentle <strike>horse</strike>.. equine.<br/></td>', 'Originally posted by Ristyz: .. It''s a nice image but I don''t care much for the PP and I can''t help my bias towards the distortion of the equine.  The wide angle caused his head to look too big for his body and like he might just fall on his face if not for the fence but it wasn''t a big enough distortion to appear as if it was shot that way on purpose. .. Thank you again (also for another chuckle) - just to clarify, I didn''t use a wide-angle lens, but yes the perspective/angle was quite sharp, intentionally.  A very gentle horse.. equine.', '2006-03-26 23:59:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(2299194, 293503, 19944, '<td valign="top">The bluish cast certainly does give a "cold" feeling to this image.</td>', 'The bluish cast certainly does give a "cold" feeling to this image.', '2006-04-09 11:07:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(2318470, 294102, 23394, '<td valign="top">this would have been helped with a tighter crop that would have let the viewer become more engaged with those soleful eyes.  also, even though you were low, i don''t think you were low enough.  for some reason, photos of animals and children seem more interesting when shot at or just below their eye-level.  <br/> <br/>i would encourage you to REALLY PRACTICE shooting without looking through the viewfinder.  get used to holding the camera down to the ground or over your head, pointing it towards your subject.  yeah, a lot of shots don''t come out, but the ones that do are usually a lot more interesting...</td>', 'this would have been helped with a tighter crop that would have let the viewer become more engaged with those soleful eyes.  also, even though you were low, i don''t think you were low enough.  for some reason, photos of animals and children seem more interesting when shot at or just below their eye-level.   i would encourage you to REALLY PRACTICE shooting without looking through the viewfinder.  get used to holding the camera down to the ground or over your head, pointing it towards your subject.  yeah, a lot of shots don''t come out, but the ones that do are usually a lot more interesting...', '2006-04-17 10:06:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(2318481, 294102, 37544, '<td valign="top">thanks skiprow...I have never tried that!</td>', 'thanks skiprow...I have never tried that!', '2006-04-17 10:11:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(2336323, 293900, 15497, '<td valign="top">Excellent!<br/></td>', 'Excellent!', '2006-04-23 11:51:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(2336484, 294492, 15711, '<td valign="top">Nice idea here.  The perspective is good but I think the tight crop at the top is what hurt you. Had you left a big tall sky, it might have made it a tad more interesting.  I love the color of the crop and the mixture of the metal buildings in the background.</td>', 'Nice idea here.  The perspective is good but I think the tight crop at the top is what hurt you. Had you left a big tall sky, it might have made it a tad more interesting.  I love the color of the crop and the mixture of the metal buildings in the background.', '2006-04-23 13:41:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(2389659, 294959, 36606, '<td valign="top">something I like about this shot. Cant put my finger on it. Seems eerie and desolate. Anyway fab photo!!</td>', 'something I like about this shot. Cant put my finger on it. Seems eerie and desolate. Anyway fab photo!!', '2006-05-07 11:05:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(2408128, 294919, 42013, '<td valign="top">excellent blue sky.  Maybe a little to much forgroudn for my taste but only my opinion. I think losing the tree on the LH side would have strengthened the picture significantly. I think the three trees would have made a nice study all by themselves.  Good shot.</td>', 'excellent blue sky.  Maybe a little to much forgroudn for my taste but only my opinion. I think losing the tree on the LH side would have strengthened the picture significantly. I think the three trees would have made a nice study all by themselves.  Good shot.', '2006-05-12 00:49:13.000000', NULL, 0),
