(2902940, 294789, 7778, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Art Roflmao:</b></div><hr/><i> Composition: 5 - Technical: 6 - Creativity: 5 - Appeal: 4 - Challenge: 3 - Overall Score: 4 - (weighted - NOT a calculated average)<br/> <br/><i>Note: <a href="//www.kpriest.com/dpchallenge/voting_notes/index.html" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Click for info</a></i> </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Composition: 7 - Technical: 6 -Creativity: 6 - Appeal: 6 - Challenge: it''s between author and rules - Overall score: 6<br/> <br/>Your portfolio reveals a keen eye for composition within a good range of common themes and genres, not necessarily with this image, but overall. I appear to keep coming back here, waiting for something you''re so, so close to achieve. <br/> <br/>Forgive my presumptueux for a little conviction...  :-)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-10-06 11:49:44.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by Art Roflmao: Composition: 5 - Technical: 6 - Creativity: 5 - Appeal: 4 - Challenge: 3 - Overall Score: 4 - (weighted - NOT a calculated average) Note: Click for info   Composition: 7 - Technical: 6 -Creativity: 6 - Appeal: 6 - Challenge: it''s between author and rules - Overall score: 6 Your portfolio reveals a keen eye for composition within a good range of common themes and genres, not necessarily with this image, but overall. I appear to keep coming back here, waiting for something you''re so, so close to achieve.  Forgive my presumptueux for a little conviction...  :-)', '2006-10-06 12:47:49.000000', '2006-10-06 12:49:44.000000', 0),
