(3036703, 294756, 37252, '<td valign="top">This is an awesome image! During voting I gave it a 9 - looking back on it I have no idea why I didn''t give it a ten. The colors, the sun rays, the magnificent sky.....absolutely stunning.</td>', 'This is an awesome image! During voting I gave it a 9 - looking back on it I have no idea why I didn''t give it a ten. The colors, the sun rays, the magnificent sky.....absolutely stunning.', '2006-11-16 03:55:31.000000', NULL, 0),
