(3124537, 293212, 39057, '<td valign="top">Wow....this has everything to do with country life....I live in the city and can''t even begin to see a star. When I go out to the "country" it looks like a million tiny flashlights.<br/> <br/><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by KHolt:</b></div><hr/><i> Thanks for sharing this photo, in its own right its interesting, however nothing to do with Country Life.  Maybe posting in the forums would have been better </i></td></tr></table></td>', 'Wow....this has everything to do with country life....I live in the city and can''t even begin to see a star. When I go out to the "country" it looks like a million tiny flashlights. Originally posted by KHolt: Thanks for sharing this photo, in its own right its interesting, however nothing to do with Country Life.  Maybe posting in the forums would have been better ', '2006-12-16 22:33:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(3148082, 294384, 65886, '<td valign="top">wonderful, wonderful photo! great in b&amp;w. the circles are almost hypnotising;) I wonder how it would look like from a higher point: a helicopter, for example? or a small tower. those lins and circles on the fields might look cool from above. I guess I should finally start flying there, too to see it ;)</td>', 'wonderful, wonderful photo! great in b&w. the circles are almost hypnotising;) I wonder how it would look like from a higher point: a helicopter, for example? or a small tower. those lins and circles on the fields might look cool from above. I guess I should finally start flying there, too to see it ;)', '2006-12-25 14:21:34.000000', NULL, 0),
